        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Town%2C_West_Virginia"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Charles Town became the county seat of Jefferson County in 1801, fulfilling a wish expressed in Charles Washington's will.",
